# GAIA is gated on HuggingFace and its terms forbid resharing the validation/test set in a
# crawlable format. Nothing derived from the gated data is committed: the task/gold/attachment
# tree is rebuilt locally by fetch_data.py, and the trace corpus (whose observations quote
# attachment contents) is reproduced by capture.py. See README.md.
data/
datafiles/
gold/
traces.otel.jsonl
runs/
*.log
